# Light scale: a dataset small enough to exercise the whole phase sequence in minutes.
# Apply explicitly:  ./experiment.sh <backend> --config conf/scale.light.env
#
# Useful for a first run on a new instance or backend, where the point is that every
# phase completes rather than the measurements themselves.
RECORDCOUNT=1000
OPERATIONCOUNT=10000
EXTEND_OPERATIONCOUNT=10000
